                "senderName": "NWS Norman OK",
                "headline": "Flood Watch issued October 16 at 2:24PM CDT until October 18 at 1:00PM CDT by NWS Norman OK",
                "description": "...The Flood Watch continues for the following rivers in Oklahoma...\nTexas...\n\nRed River near Burkburnett affecting Jefferson, Wichita, Clay,\nCotton and Tillman Counties.\n\n* WHAT...Flooding is possible.\n\n* WHERE...Red River near Burkburnett.\n\n* WHEN...From Saturday evening to Sunday afternoon.\n\n* ADDITIONAL DETAILS...\n- At 1:30 PM CDT Friday the stage was 7.0 feet.\n- Forecast...Flood stage may be reached late tomorrow evening.\n- Flood stage is 9.0 feet.\n- http://www.weather.gov/safety/flood",
                "instruction": "If you are in the watch area, remain alert to possible flooding.\n\nAdditional information is available at www.weather.gov.\n\nThe next statement will be issued late tonight at 430 AM CDT.",
